---
description: React frontend rules
globs: frontend/**
alwaysApply: false
---
Cursor was not used to build this repository; these rules mirror `.claude/agents/react-worker.md`.

- Types only from `src/api/contract.gen.ts` (generated by `npm run contract:gen`); never hand-edit it.
- No chart library, web font, icon set, CDN tag or external URL at runtime.
- Render data as text; no `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`. Loading, error and empty states are text.
- Build against `npm run dev:mock` (contract examples at `/api/*`) until the backend is up; `npm run dev` proxies `/api` to 127.0.0.1:8080.
